## Setup

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/Sakhawat-4/my-ml-internship-v2]
```

### 2. Open the project folder

```bash
cd [FLYRANK ML PROJECT/ ML PORTFOLIO]
```

### 3. Install the required libraries

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. Run the project

```bash
python [YOUR MAIN FILE].py
```

Use the actual filename and command required by the project.

